The Ultimate Tool for Orienteering
LegendMaster is a specialized application built specifically for Sport Orienteering. It combines traditional navigation techniques with modern digital tools, making it the perfect companion for both professional competitors and beginners.

Core Orienteering Features:
Classic Orienteering Compass: A high-precision compass designed in the classic style familiar to every orienteer. It provides quick orientation and stable heading even in dense forest conditions.

ISOM 2024 Standard Legend Gallery: Stay up to date with the latest international standards. The app includes a comprehensive gallery of control point symbols according to the ISOM 2024 (International Specification for Orienteering Maps), ensuring your digital legends are always accurate and readable.

"Back to Start" for Beginners: An essential safety feature for newbies. If you lose your way, a dedicated navigation screen provides a clear directional arrow and distance back to the starting point, helping you return safely.

Smart SPOOF Detection for UA region: The app automatically detects GPS signal anomalies or "spoofing" attempts, alerting you to positioning errors and ensuring the technical reliability of your track.

Automatic double step counter, coupled with meters on all screens.

The LegendMaster Ecosystem:
To get the most out of your race, use our mobile companion. Download "LegendMaster" from the Google Play Store to:

Easily build your course and CP legends using ISOM 2024 symbols.

Wirelessly sync your race data to your Garmin watch via Bluetooth.

Update checkpoint descriptions on the fly.

Advanced Activity Tracking:
Multi-Page UI: Toggle instantly between the Classic Compass, Legend Gallery, Navigation, and Main Activity metrics.

Professional Stats: Track heart rate, distance, and real-time step-to-paces conversion.

Garmin Connect Integration: All activities are recorded as standard FIT files, allowing you to analyze your route and performance in Garmin Connect or upload to Strava/Livelox.

Rugged UI: High-contrast interface optimized for the Fenix, Enduro, and Forerunner series, ensuring clarity while running through shadows or bright sunlight.